aphrody-code-graph
Copyright 2026 aphrody contributors, licensed under Apache-2.0.

This crate re-implements, in Rust, the concepts and the `graph.json` interchange format of
Graphify (https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify, branch v8, Apache-2.0, with LICENSE,
LICENSE-MIT and NOTICE files in the upstream repository): code nodes, typed edges with
EXTRACTED / INFERRED / AMBIGUOUS confidence, communities, god nodes, and the query, path and
explain operations. No Graphify source file is copied verbatim; behaviours are compared with the
installed Graphify package, used only as a parity oracle in tests, until parity is proven.
Statement of changes: native Rust implementation, storage in the aphrody home database, no
language-model labelling and no network access.
